llenged against A rather than allowed to drift upward; A+ is retained because the Tokyo performance has a stronger event-specific cultural-exchange context than a generic OurHome tour stop. This batch adds A 0 / A+ 1 / S 0 / S+ 0 without using distribution as a quota.",
